<li>If you want a quick, plant protein-packed salad that is ready in 30 minutes, try my <a href="https://foolproofliving.com/mediterranean-quinoa-salad/">Mediterranean Quinoa Salad</a>. It can also be served cold or warm and it is another salad recipe that you can make ahead.</li>
</ul>


